error[RB0304]: `Stop` has no field `s`, so `event` in `on Go | Stop` does not have it
  --> RB0304-or-events-field.road:10:38
   |
10 |     on Go | Stop -> B  set s = event.s
   |                                      ^
   |
   = help: `Go` and `Stop` have no field of the same type; read `event` in an `on` of each event's own

